            <p
              style="font-size:20px;line-height:24px;margin:16px 0;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:35px;padding:0 20px"
            >
              Dear
              <!-- -->
              VLAD<!-- -->,
            </p>
            <p
              style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;margin:16px 0;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:35px;padding:0 20px"
            >
              Thank you for registering on the CORE ELD Platform.
            </p>
            <p
              style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;margin:16px 0;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:35px;padding:0 20px"
            >
              We would like to inform you that your account is currently in a
              &quot;Temporary&quot; status.
            </p>
            <p
              style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;margin:16px 0;margin-bottom:35px;padding:0 20px"
            >
              This means that our team is in the process of verifying the
              information you provided during registration. You will be able to
              log into the system and access certain features, although some
              functionality may be limited until verification is complete.
            </p>
            <p
              style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;margin:16px 0;margin-bottom:35px;padding:0 20px"
            >
              If you have any questions or need assistance, please contact us
              at<span style="color:blue"> eld24@corelines.us</span>.
            </p>
            <p
              style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;margin:16px 0;margin-bottom:35px;padding:0 20px"
            >
              Best regards,<br />
              <b>Core ELD Team.</b> <br />
              <b>Phone:</b> <span style="color:blue"> (509) 579-3104</span
              ><br /><b>Email:</b
              ><span style="color:blue"> eld24@corelines.us</span>
            </p>
            <p
              style="font-size:8px;line-height:1.2;margin:16px 0;padding:0 20px"
            >
              Core ELD has undergone rigorous testing in accordance with the
              FMCSA&#x27;s Test Plan and Procedures and meets the functional
              requirements included in the 49 CFR Appendix A to Subpart B of
              Part 395 - Appendix A to Subpart B of Part 395-Functional
              Specifications for All Electronic Logging Devices (ELDs).
            </p>
            <img
              src="/static/bottom-insert.png"
              style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;width:100%"
            />
          </td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
